## Proposed Changes

### Component: dine_ai

#### [MODIFY] [app.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/app.py)

We will rewrite `app.py` to contain the full production implementation of the following classes:

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class DineAIApplication {
        +ApplicationConfig config
        +ApplicationState state
        +RestaurantManager restaurant_manager
        +ConversationManager conversation_manager
